# GLSL: The OpenGL Shading Language 4.60 specification, 3 Basics, 4 Variables and Types, 8 Built-in Functions; requirements/languages/glsl.md
name     glsl vert frag

keyword  attribute const uniform varying buffer shared layout centroid flat smooth noperspective patch
keyword  sample break continue do for while switch case default if else in out inout return discard
keyword  struct precision highp mediump lowp invariant subroutine
type     void bool int uint float double vec2 vec3 vec4 ivec2 ivec3 ivec4 uvec2 uvec3 uvec4 bvec2 bvec3
type     bvec4 dvec2 dvec3 dvec4 mat2 mat3 mat4 mat2x2 mat3x3 mat4x4 sampler2D sampler3D samplerCube
type     sampler2DShadow image2D
builtin  true false gl_Position gl_FragCoord gl_FragColor gl_FragDepth gl_VertexID gl_InstanceID
builtin  texture normalize dot cross mix clamp smoothstep step length distance reflect pow sin cos
builtin  max min abs floor fract

line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
hook     c-preprocessor
